      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like, if the system has already erased me, what's the point of fighting to stay in it? everything i do just leads back to nothing. it feels like there's no way to actually win. it's just a loop of misery. sometimes i think maybe the only way to actually stop the noise and the feeling of being nothing is to just... let go. like, if i can't exist in their world, maybe i shouldn't be in any world at all.",
